#: frontend/admin/letsencrypt.php:91
msgid ""
"Couldn't issue new SSL certificate for the control panel. You must first "
"enable SSL for the control panel by executing the 'imscp-reconfigure -dar "
"panel_ssl' command. A self-signed SSL certificate is sufficient. It will be "
"automatically replaced by the Let's Encrypt SSL certificate."
msgstr ""
"Impossible d'émettre un nouveau certificat SSL pour le panneau de contrôle. "
"Vous devez d'abord activer SSL pour le panneau de contrôle en exécutant la "
"commande 'imscp-reconfigure -dar panel_ssl'. Un certificat SSL auto-signé "
"est suffisant. Il sera automatiquement remplacé par le certificat SSL Let's "
"Encrypt."

#: frontend/admin/letsencrypt.php:94
msgid ""
"Couldn't issue new SSL certificate for the services. You must first enable "
"SSL for the services by running the 'imscp-reconfigure -dar services_ssl' "
"command. A self-signed SSL certificate is sufficient. It will be "
"automatically replaced by Let's Encrypt SSL certificate."
msgstr ""
"Impossible d'émettre un nouveau certificat SSL pour les services. Vous devez "
"d'abord activer SSL pour les services en exécutant la commande 'imscp-"
"reconfigure -dar services_ssl'. Un certificat SSL auto-signé est suffisant. "
"Il sera automatiquement remplacé par le certificat SSL Let's Encrypt."

